Licence provenance
------------------

This codebase was originally derived from the Magic Portfolio template by
Once UI (licensed CC BY-NC 4.0, which prohibits commercial use). Because
this site markets commercial freelance services, all Magic Portfolio
template code, content, styles and assets were removed and replaced with
an original implementation. Remaining third-party software is limited to
permissively licensed open-source dependencies:

- Next.js (MIT)
- React (MIT)
- Tailwind CSS (MIT)
- Geist fonts (SIL OFL 1.1, via next/font)

No CC BY-NC-licensed code or assets remain in this repository.
